    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- `POST /v1/plans` accepts `tiers_mode` and `tiers` on metered plans without a price, rejects invalid tiers and tiers on licensed plans with 422 `invalid_tiers`, and returns `tiers_mode` and `tiers` in minor units.\n- `billing.TieredAmount` implements graduated and volume pricing with inclusive `up_to` and 0 for quantity 0.\n- A tiered plan's renewal bills one line (quantity 1, `unit_amount` = `TieredAmount(usage)`, description starting with the plan name), and a period with no usage creates no invoice. `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` all pass, with new tests for each part.",
